WEBVTT

00:08:28.083 --> 00:08:30.309
COVID-19 sharply slowed

00:08:30.333 --> 00:08:32.934
the building of new
renewable energy plants.

00:08:32.958 --> 00:08:34.851
Even larger challenges loom.

00:08:34.875 --> 00:08:38.476
First, India's electricity
distribution utilities

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:41.018
are mismanaged, economically fragile

00:08:41.042 --> 00:08:42.934
and forced by many states

00:08:42.958 --> 00:08:46.351
to subsidize power to farmers
and residential customers.

00:08:46.375 --> 00:08:47.726
India needs reforms

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:50.684
to more efficiently combat energy poverty

00:08:50.708 --> 00:08:55.976
while overhauling unprofitable utilities
so they can pay for clean energy on time.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.101
Doing so will make it possible

00:08:58.125 --> 00:09:01.643
to raise trillions of dollars
at home and abroad